  "keyFeatures": [
    "Unified ticket inbox for email, chat, and web submissions",
    "Intelligent triage and routing rules for complex technical cases",
    "Rich internal notes and threaded collaboration for support agents",
    "SLA policies and escalation workflows",
    "Customizable ticket fields for capturing detailed technical context",
    "Canned responses and knowledge base suggestions",
    "Webhook and API integrations with developer tooling",
    "Role-based access control for agents and teams",
    "Merge and link related tickets to reduce duplication",
    "Customer communication timeline with full history"
